    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d499">

                <pb facs="0633" n="565" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg565"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Count
                        Wydenbruch.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1867-05-28"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi>
                            28, 1867.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Count</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note of this date, inquiring as to the authenticity of a
                    telegram relative to recent events at Queretaro, published in the papers of this
                    morning. In reply, I have the honor <pb facs="0634" n="566" xml:id="pg566"/> to
                    inform you that the telegram referred to, having been received at this
                    department from Mr. Campbell, United States minister at Mexico, who is now at
                    New Orleans, is believed to be correct.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this occasion, count, to offer you a renewed assurance of my
                    very high consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Count <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wydenbruck</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d499-a1.xml" xpointer="d499-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
